        <h1>Compress Images, <em>Nothing Uploaded</em></h1>
        <p class="dek">A plain guide to shrinking image files: how much smaller WebP really is, when to keep PNG, why the popular compressors upload your photo to a server, and how compressing quietly strips the hidden GPS location from a picture. The Best Answer Hub Image Compressor does it all in your browser.</p>
